### Cancelar una invitación (con US002 o US004) — libera su licencia de Jobs (200, availableLicenses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/cancelInvitation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3262
}

### Invitación ya cancelada → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/cancelInvitation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3262
}
